      "why": "This converts the affirmative from 'shield industry' into 'reduce total injury,' which is the accelerationist's highest-leverage rhetorical move: it takes the harm-reduction frame away from the opposition. It directly operationalizes the topic's own Noise Thesis and makes the excise tax a harm-internalization mechanism rather than a giveaway. Self-monitor flag: acc-beliefs-074 invokes Bastiat's unseen-benefits logic selectively; I must concede that the same reasoning demands equal accounting of AI's own unseen harms — which is precisely what the excise-funded compensation board and oversight_audit provide.",
